---
title: "Retry checks its basis. Repeating does not decide again"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  s0: Approved. Ticket checks its basis
  s1: First ticket issued
  s2: Approved. Basis ended
  s3: Received. Repeat checks its basis
  s4: Repeat ticket issued
  s5: Received. Basis ended
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: issue a ticket with Send or a checked current basis
  s0 --> s2: authority ends or his word expires or is overtaken
  s1 --> s0: delivery fails without a receipt
  s1 --> s3: record delivery without deciding another ask
  s3 --> s4: issue a ticket with Send or a checked current basis
  s1 --> s2: delivery fails without a receipt
  s1 --> s5: record delivery without deciding another ask
  s3 --> s5: authority ends or his word expires or is overtaken
  s4 --> s3: delivery fails without a receipt or record delivery without deciding another ask
  s2 --> s0: captain gives fresh words or a new authority covers the retry
  s4 --> s5: delivery fails without a receipt or record delivery without deciding another ask
